File: segmentation_id9.nrrd

This NRRD segmentation volume exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, so it is not
committed here. It can be provided by communicating with the authors (see the
contact details in the top-level README.md and source_data/README.md).

To use it: obtain the file from the authors and place it here with this exact
name (without the ".PLACEHOLDER" suffix), then run the relevant generate_data.py.
